# Small-signal analysis, all regenerated by InterAreaOscillations.ipynb Part 3.
# Part 3 now runs through stepss.ssa, which puts each variant's results in its
# own directory so the two runs cannot overwrite each other, and writes the
# disturbance file itself: EIG must fire before anything else happens, so it
# needs a scenario with no events in it, and both the module and the GUI
# generate that rather than shipping one. The bare eig.* entries are what
# earlier versions of the notebook wrote into this directory.
ssa_pss/
ssa_nopss/
eig.dst
eig_*.dat
fort.*
